flowchart TD
  subgraph J001["J-001 Import a routine (FR-001 to FR-016)"]
    A[Pick yaml file or start from scratch] --> B{Parses and structurally valid?}
    B -- no --> X[Rejected: file could not be read]
    B -- yes --> C[Step 1 Exercises: edit, remove, reorder, add, rename, replace]
    C --> D{Semantic issues left?}
    D -- yes --> C
    D -- no --> E[Step 2 Suggested days, weeks, start date]
    E --> F{Another Routine active?}
    F -- yes --> G[Warn it will be archived; optionally remove its remaining Placements]
    F -- no --> H
    G --> H[Accept: one transaction stores Routine, Workouts, Planned Exercises, new Exercises, Placements]
    H --> I[Routine active; Placements in calendar; request persistent storage]
  end

  subgraph J002["J-002 and J-003 Train and resume (FR-030 to FR-059)"]
    T[Today: placed Workout, else next in rotation] --> O{Session in progress?}
    O -- yes --> R[Resume session]
    O -- no --> S[Start Workout: snapshot targets of every planned exercise]
    S --> P[Open exercise: show previous and suggestion]
    R --> P
    P --> L[Log set, persisted immediately]
    L --> RT[Rest countdown from set time]
    RT --> L
    P --> DV[Skip, reorder, add unplanned, edit or delete set]
    DV --> P
    L --> FN[Finish]
    FN --> ST{Any exercise pending?}
    ST -- yes --> PA[partial]
    ST -- no --> CO[completed]
    PA --> BR[Backup reminder if due; request persistent storage]
    CO --> BR
  end

  subgraph J005["J-005 Backup and restore (FR-075 to FR-083)"]
    EX[Export backup] --> PW{Password?}
    PW -- yes --> EN[Encrypt envelope]
    PW -- no --> SV
    EN --> SV[Save via share sheet or download]
    IM[Pick backup on new device] --> EC{Encrypted?}
    EC -- yes --> AP[Ask password; wrong or tampered means nothing restored]
    EC -- no --> VA
    AP --> VA{Valid and version not newer?}
    VA -- no --> RJ[Refused, nothing changed]
    VA -- yes --> SM[Summary, warning if a Session is open]
    SM --> SB[Save safety backup of current data]
    SB --> RP[Replace 8 training stores in one transaction; Settings untouched]
  end
